# - "exit 1" after the tasks.toml diff is diff's status for "files differ": the four changed lines are the intended edit.
# - Duplicate merge: no row was merged. Every English key in the old topic file was already unique (lint 0 errors), and
#   the near-duplicates (e.g. "data audit" / "data audit (Milestone 2)", "grain" / "grain (Milestone 3 running text)",
#   the five "capacity" rows) are separate keys in the merged glossary, so removing any would change the snapshot.
